' imported from the release disk (MASTER D1 231231.d81), "i/SM.sigedit" with:
'   tools/detok.sh (C64List4_04.exe -txt -keycase -varcase -alpha:alt)
' line numbers are kept as they were; jumps to lines in im (gosub 3, goto 5, ...)
' resolve through 3_0-preface.lbl. unchanged, this builds a program identical
' to the original, except that capitals in rem text are $61-$7a, not $c1-$da.
' (by hand, after detok.sh --keep-spaces: the {assign:4650} and the {$3a} below)

{uses:../3_0-preface.lbl}
{alpha:alt}
' 4632 jumps to 4650, which isn't in this module (nor in im): an error if it
' is ever run. the assign keeps the jump as it was in the release.
{assign:4650	=4650	}

